From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: route Escape from Journal detail to its main view

The shared semantic KeyHandler captures Escape before Journal's child
controller.  Its journal branch previously returned without action, leaving a
detail canvas active and making the next Journal entry reparent unsafe.  Let
the existing JournalActivity restore its main view, while preserving the
no-close behavior for the Journal itself.

--- a/src/jarabe/view/keyhandler.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/view/keyhandler.py
@@ -142,4 +142,7 @@
     def handle_close_window(self, event_time):
         active_activity = shell.get_model().get_active_activity()
         if active_activity is None or active_activity.is_journal():
+            if active_activity is not None and hasattr(active_activity,
+                                                       'show_main_view'):
+                active_activity.show_main_view()
             return
